- publish/owned_photography: prompt_for/make take rung constraints, records carry the rung,
  rung_attempts/ordinary_attempts give rungs their own one-attempt budget
- visual/tournament.alternate_provider for the change_tool rung
- runtime/release: _owned_photography_rung executes the named strategy and writes
  creative.escalation_result (attempted / not attemptable, usable, provider, composition);
  the model path persists its rung result too; retention entry added
- tests/test_gallery_escalation.py: the ladder walked through store.publish and the
  photography job, rung by rung, to the deterministic rung; a rung is never repeated

